message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it using the metadata below and cite the individual software tools listed in the README."
title: "Metagenome Pipeline"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Franco"
    given-names: "Gabriela Crystal"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-3393-3220"

version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-05
license: MIT

keywords:
  - metagenomics
  - bioinformatics
  - metagenome-assembled genomes
  - MAGs
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - microbiology

abstract: >-
  A script based bioinformatics pipeline for paired-end metagenomic
  sequencing data, including read trimming, assembly, genome binning,
  MAG quality assessment, taxonomic classification, read mapping,
  prevalence estimation, and antimicrobial resistance annotation.